messages around verack
  ping with no version yet: ignored (no version yet)
  ping before verack: ignored (before verack)
  ping after verack: done; sends pong
  wtxidrelay before verack: done
  wtxidrelay after verack: disconnect (after verack)
  sendaddrv2 after verack: disconnect (after verack)
  sendheaders before verack: done
  sendcmpct 1, version 2, after verack: done
  sendcmpct 1, version 1: ignored (not version 2)
  sendcmpct 2, version 2: disconnect (bad announce field)
  feature "test" before verack: ignored (unknown feature)
  feature "test" after verack: disconnect (after verack)
  sendtxrcncl before verack: ignored (reconciliation off)
  headers after verack: deliver
  version again: ignored (redundant version)
